<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi{{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to high standards</strong><br />
<br />
We want our customers to have an exceptional experience each time they fly with us, so I’m sorry to hear about the unhelpful attitude of the crew on board QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}}.<br />
<br />
We’ve always been committed to providing customers with a premium, professional and helpful service, so I understand your disappointment at the service on this occasion.<br />
<br />
<strong>If requesting follow up add:-&nbsp;</strong><br />
<br />
I’m sure you can appreciate that I'm unable to advise you of any internal investigation or discipline outcomes due to privacy legislation.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with an exceptional experience from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I’ve passed on your feedback to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience and I hope we deliver an exceptional service next time you fly with Qantas.</p>
</body>
